{"id":"mg1","ok":true,"result":{"_rev":0,"body":"---\ndescription: How an SDK release is cut, tagged and announced\n---\nCut the release branch on Monday, tag after the canary has run for a day, and announce in the changelog feed once the packages are live.","created":"2026-09-05T09:15:00Z","id":"eb864f1e-e68a-4d96-af89-597bd0d2d52e","modified":"2026-09-10T09:15:00Z","origin_mtime":null,"origin_path":null,"origin_size":null,"project":"api","source":"docs/release.md","standing":false,"title":"release-process"},"tasqx":"1"}
